## Design Decisions Summary

| Decision | Choice | Rationale |
|----------|--------|-----------|
| Storage | In-memory array | Self-contained, no external dependencies |
| IDs | Auto-increment integers | Simple; UUIDs for production |
| Error handling | Custom classes + middleware | Consistent responses, type-safe checks |
| Async pattern | `async/await` on all handlers | Ready for DB swap, linear readability |
| Update style | Full replacement (PUT) | Clear semantics; PATCH can be added later |
| Port | Env var with 3000 default | Cloud-platform compatible |
```

