# 📚 Book Management REST API

An educational REST API for managing books, built with **Node.js** and **Express.js**. This project demonstrates REST conventions, middleware composition, error handling, and input validation — all with comprehensive documentation.

## 🚀 Quick Start

### Prerequisites
- Node.js 18+ installed
- npm or yarn package manager

### Installation
```bash
# Clone the repository (if applicable)
git clone <repository-url>
cd book-management-api

# Install dependencies
npm install

# Start the development server (with auto-reload)
npm run dev

# Or start in production mode
npm start
